-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=15761","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=15761","timestampSeconds":1616,"timestampLabel":"26:56","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- away. So to answer your question, Dana, I don't know exactly how that would work out. A lot of it would","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-15761-tx-1623-207","meetingDate":"2026-04-21","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 4/21","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=15761","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=15761","timestampSeconds":1623,"timestampLabel":"27:03","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- depend on what the government allows us to do with the grant in order to open that position back up,","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-15761-tx-1629-208","meetingDate":"2026-04-21","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 4/21","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=15761","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=15761","timestampSeconds":1629,"timestampLabel":"27:09","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- and then would they allow us to hire someone with a counseling degree? Would they allow us to hire someone","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-15761-tx-1635-209","meetingDate":"2026-04-21","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 4/21","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=15761","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=15761","timestampSeconds":1635,"timestampLabel":"27:15","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- with a social work degree? Would it have to be a school psychologis